<title>UK: Iran tells OPEC April output/supply 3.592 mln bpd.</title>
<headline>Iran tells OPEC April output/supply 3.592 mln bpd.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran told OPEC it produced 3.592 million barrels per day (bpd) in April, the OPEC news agency (OPECNA) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The data were submitted directly to OPEC headquarters in Vienna.</p>
<p>Iran, OPEC's second biggest exporter, said its supply to the market was also 3.592 million bpd in April, within its OPEC quota of 3.6 million bpd.</p>
<p>A Reuter survey of analysts and industry sources earlier this month found that Iran produced 3.71 million bpd in April.</p>
<p>Last week, OPECNA said the 11 members of the group told the secretariat they pumped 25.61 million bpd of crude in April, up from 25.46 million bpd in March.</p>
